<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>IPL 2026 Ball-by-Ball Analytics Report</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0f172a;--card:#1e293b;--text:#e2e8f0;--muted:#94a3b8;--accent:#38bdf8;--accent2:#f472b6;--accent3:#34d399;--border:#334155;}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Oxygen,Ubuntu,Cantarell,"Open Sans","Helvetica Neue",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.6}
.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px}
header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:24px}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-0.5px}
header p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem}
.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px}
.kpi-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;text-align:center}
.kpi-value{font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin:4px 0}
.kpi-label{font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px}
.kpi-desc{font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
.section{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:22px}
.section h2{margin-top:0;font-size:1.35rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:14px;color:var(--accent)}
.section h3{font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--accent2);margin:18px 0 10px}
.chart-container{text-align:center;margin:14px 0}
.chart-container img{max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
.chart-caption{font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:0.9rem}
th,td{padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
th{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;font-size:0.78rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.4px}
tr:hover td{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
...
</table>
<p class="note"><strong>Insight:</strong> Chasing teams score faster (9.58 RR vs 9.13 RR) and hit boundaries more frequently (23.04% vs 20.12%), suggesting smaller targets or better clarity of intent in the second innings.</p>
</div>

<footer style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:12px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.8rem;text-align:center">
Generated from IPL 2026 ball-by-ball delivery data &middot; 3,284 deliveries across 15 matches &middot; All statistics derived directly from source dataset.
</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
